{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "55589727fbb5b5e777da32e583fde08a051f30efab3bf18c106aaf99dc9352a6", "ja": "（今日も39プロジェクトのオーディションだ。\nさて、次の子は……天空橋、珍しい名字だな）", "zh": "（今天也持续进行着39PROJECT的成员甄选。\n下一位是……天空桥，这姓氏真特别。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "f9b8923e4e6c1964f4c6d6066241bc4fd38841db1fef88ed5b39347cc3c8b4ed", "ja": "初めまして、天空橋朋花と申します。\n本日は、よろしくお願いしますね～♪", "zh": "初次见面，我是天空桥朋花。\n今天还请多多指教～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "46add07e2e7264acb9592c8d64216c5f87858ca2aabd4c114fd406b41429d516", "ja": "（綺麗な子だな。態度も堂々としてるし……\n期待できそうだ）", "zh": "（这孩子真漂亮，态度也很大方……\n看来很值得期待。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "e1c35140d67fe9fa7534c90c503f17d5abd1d69ca069bec64bda61e15228ef79", "ja": "あなたが、ここのプロデューサーさんですか～？\nなるほど……どんな方か、大体わかりましたよ～。", "zh": "你就是这里的制作人吗～？\n原来如此……我大概知道你是怎么样的人了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "b9a567e1129424ebe01bff64c7cef92ad6308c0561394c1969d79fae05fc851b", "ja": "少し頼りない感じですが、真面目な方のようですね～。\n安心しました～。", "zh": "虽然你感觉有点靠不住，但好像是个老实人呢～\n我放心了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8e6b9d2868d4a496258136dfd8ad5c8cd5889df785c88095e88a1caecac543a0", "ja": "そ、そうか。それはよかった。\nそれじゃ、さっそく質問に入るけど……", "zh": "是、是吗？那真是太好了。\n那么我马上来问你几个问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d4c14c61c1882726bbc83840ca62381a7d08f9c7458c0dfdfc77ab14aba73d1c", "ja": "君はどうして、アイドルを目指そうと思ったのかな？", "zh": "你为什么想当偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "30991c67742618b6e0e6c55e3f2b4b3a1c370a247bdbcb5bab9067b736cc7b7d", "ja": "私がアイドルを目指そうと思った理由、ですか～？\nそれは、子豚ちゃん達に愛を与えるためですね～。", "zh": "我想当偶像的理由吗～？\n是为了给小猪们爱啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "28e1fc018658ce98574eb637d3b397596b0edad4a8df80b6e700a96b62754d09", "ja": "ん？\nこぶ……え？", "zh": "嗯？\n小猪……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "e5a455c19cfb42eb1d588a1786664f1c7219004bb4ecd6d0d49f6cf454aec33c", "ja": "子豚ちゃんというのは、私のことが好きで好きで\n仕方がない、困ったちゃんなファンのことです～。", "zh": "所谓的小猪就是喜欢我喜欢到不行，\n让人伤脑筋的粉丝啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "4863c8cf838a5f4329693eab0d49a7027196f18ecf8e589c59b04dd53b38d7dc", "ja": "『子羊ちゃん』と言うより、『子豚ちゃん』のほうが\n可愛いでしょう～？　そう思いませんか～。", "zh": "与其叫『小羊』，还是叫『小猪』比较可爱吧～？\n你不这么觉得吗～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e48456fdcf7f329c440a98e2416bb62cea3ead9ebb7cd7700bbf25fda7519da1", "ja": "可愛い……かな……。\nええと、つまり、君にはファンがいるんだね。", "zh": "可爱……吗……\n呃，也就是说，你已经有粉丝了是吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "04eb26bed529f9cfc82438da7f4b3764ac21830e95ea298e0f3a2e27e38d5544", "ja": "はい～。中でも特に熱心な人達は、\n『天空騎士団』と呼ばれていますね～。", "zh": "是啊～其中特别热衷的粉丝们，\n又被称为『天空骑士团』喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5c338cd96a648b83bf9d96a0ddec87b30952aa7251006a9dca0e52faefac9d87", "ja": "へえ……。\nその天空騎士団っていうのは、君のファンクラブ？", "zh": "是喔……\n那个天空骑士团，是你的粉丝俱乐部吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "7f9a1f7926ca9c5619936d3d1d87e6b7673d19525f409cbe935a656195411a8a", "ja": "そうですね～。\nファンクラブとか、親衛隊的なものでしょうか～？", "zh": "对呀～\n算是粉丝俱乐部或亲卫队之类的吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3a1e0423193126b7ef23776e690217c004bf6ceba7b90c96ddd5147d10e22981", "ja": "（ファンクラブか、親衛隊……\nどっちにしろ、すごいな……）", "zh": "（粉丝俱乐部或亲卫队……\n不管是哪个，都好厉害……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "e242c382cb7005bbb5b93f796c96ae3148505a2206af50ce1f3955e0272259f6", "ja": "ただ、困ったことに……私のことが好きすぎて、時々、\nケンカをしてしまう子豚ちゃんがいるんです～。", "zh": "但让人伤脑筋的是……他们太喜欢我了，\n有时小猪们也会吵架～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6887e86ce46a8b8af89e717492a49016280735643a446a7843fccbacc4b1cf0b", "ja": "それは困るね。", "zh": "这样的确很伤脑筋呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "ba6d1f45e4545ae7ed9c2f67864ae809464975abaee8329800b8546d23ae47e3", "ja": "私は、争い事が嫌いなんです～。\nみんなに、仲良くしてほしいんですね～。", "zh": "我讨厌争执～\n希望大家都可以和乐相处～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "b08f7e594f16facc812635d000c6c0908d65d427decf8bf470506c6fc962eb43", "ja": "それを、同級生に相談したところ……\nアイドルになることを、勧められたんです～。", "zh": "然后我去找同学聊过之后……\n对方就建议我来当偶像～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "da31c6dd4ca9519a11aa2a2c49388fa5b471a0cb31309dcea68db5d4493ea1b9", "ja": "アイドルになれば、聖母の愛を、平等に\n分け与えることができるのではないかと～。", "zh": "我在想是不是只要当上偶像，\n就能把圣母的爱平等地分给大家～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e552c62044365702015c9a4a2f446be3a54a56157d92aa602287b6872c2f51e7", "ja": "（出てくる単語が何かすごいけど……\nつまり、自分のファンを大切にしてるってことか？）", "zh": "（虽然用词有点夸张……\n但总之是在珍惜自己的粉丝吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "521bc1119197eed959bd5b385494b8e8b0a438d99e816a0f61b3e8f81981feda", "ja": "アイドルがどういうものなのか、\n私にはよくわかりませんが……。", "zh": "虽然我不太清楚偶像究竟是什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "8b3d2bd33d04bcd7bf6d6e9ab1843f39b66820009c447a9639702bb1da22ff5b", "ja": "子豚ちゃん達のような人々に、愛を与える、\nとてもいい職業だと聞きました～。", "zh": "但听说这是能把爱传播给那些像小猪一样的人们，\n非常棒的职业～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "8bbf4a1399b5b1a122761f3e2215233c22fe6dae96d1f182212a624e1062963b", "ja": "それなら私は、アイドルになるべきだと\n思ったんですよ～♪", "zh": "既然如此，\n那我就该当偶像～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1026_p", "source_sha256": "9b33ae0cc1f8f26271613b54512fbef9029639a423b5da09bea85f2a2b34322e", "ja": "なるほど。\n君のアイドルへの想い、よくわかりました。", "zh": "原来如此。\n我明白你对偶像的想法了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "ff95a804ec1f58eb5fae9518fee7f45077ac4e5769f620e3d73fb3ebbdbb861e", "ja": "うふふ、理解が早くて助かります～♪\n相互理解は、パートナーには必須ですからね～。", "zh": "呵呵，你理解得很快真是太好了～♪\n因为搭档之间就是需要互相理解～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1028_p", "source_sha256": "3f045db692ffc8a7e3dd593ee6b111112b428bfd824384de3f10e2ceb8fd533c", "ja": "あ、いや、まだ合格だって決めたわけじゃ……", "zh": "啊，不，还没决定要录取你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "6914e4671b9986de83390e2cfd836783ebe03ce0227fc1557effadfcf093eb6b", "ja": "遠からずそうなるのですから、\n同じことです～。", "zh": "毕竟不久之后就会录取了，\n所以都是一样的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "24095cbc7514b690aa5c056cc169a3307f851654a618ed976cf6f0594cf9b5f5", "ja": "プロデューサーさん、期待していますよ～。\nこれから私のために、頑張ってくださいね～♪", "zh": "制作人先生，我很看好你喔～\n今后要为了我好好努力喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_1031", "source_sha256": "8f90d85ec13a0b1b12d81203f2f3262ca156028a94aeaf91ae52fcd5a9de4170", "ja": "はい", "zh": "遵命", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "103e41e610c75950396a4a93bd62f51859628f3c92294d83e5f3a503e154c7df", "ja": "はい……いや、わかった。任せてくれ！", "zh": "遵命……不，我知道了。交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_001_2001_p", "source_sha256": "506e4f16ba8bce9dbccb7ea5f469d20f544ab828a87367e9cf0d8dd769c5ba27", "ja": "（つい勢いで返事をしたけど……彼女の信念は本物だ。\n個性もあるし、合格……だな！）", "zh": "（虽然顺口就答应了……但她的信念是真的。\n而且也很有个性，所以就……录取吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
